{
  "info": {
    "name": "Chat App REST — Complete REST Flow",
    "description": "Run requests 01–17 manually in order. Before each dependent request, copy IDs and tokens from the previous response into the collection variables; this collection intentionally contains no scripts that generate or overwrite variable data. Set emailA, emailB, and password before registration. Password must contain 8+ Unicode code points and at most 72 UTF-8 bytes. Requires the API on baseUrl with current migrations applied. The requests cover registration, login, access/refresh tokens, user discovery, direct chat, messaging, unread/read state, conversation reuse, and the three HTTP 401 error codes. WebSocket is intentionally outside this REST collection.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
